<h2>Need More Information?</h2>
<p>DM me for more information about me, my experience, or my staff work in Piece-game communities.</p>
</div>
<a class="btn primary" href="https://discord.com/users/1031824269593817088" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DM Me on Discord ↗</a>
</div>
</section>
</div>
</main>

<footer class="container">
<span>© <span id="year"></span> Rizve. All rights reserved.</span>
<span>Piece Game Staff Portfolio</span>
</footer>
